          <title type="preferred">Śāhajivilāsagītā</title>
          <title type="variant">Śāhavilāsagīta</title>
          <editor key="p_9" role="aut">Ḍhuṇḍirāja Vyāsa</editor>
          <editor key="p_6" role="pat">Śāhaji I (of Thanjavur)</editor>
          <note type="genre">Musical</note>
          <note type="general">Modelled on the Gītagovinda: just as there are three main characters in the Gītagovinda - Krishna, Radhā and her maid - in this work the three characters are king Śahaji I, the courtesan Līlavatī and her maid. Consists of eight sargas and 24 aṣṭapadis.</note>
